OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrests after
OL,4,Aboy, 16, attacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys aged 15 and 16 have been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,8,Fmurder after a 16-year-old was
OL,9,Fseriously assaulted in Liverpool,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to The Lutine Bell
OL,13,Fpub on Breck Road in Everton at about
OL,14,F14:15 BST following reports of a boy
OL,15,Fbeing assaulted nearby. He was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital with head and chest injuries
OL,17,Fwhere he remains in a serious
OL,18,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
